    "independentAuditPreparation": "The first read-only check stopped at an overly strict source-object equality: workload records include a repository URL omitted by package manifests. Inspection confirmed their commit, clean flag and every source record match; the final check also explicitly validates the workload's repository URL. No measured code ran during either read-only check.",
